  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1a633f449938a194e9738ad7bc2507bb, type: 3}
  m_Name: Chat 14
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textLine:
  - text: I have been analyzing the bone remains that you gathered earlier.
    speaker: 1
  - text: Considering the condition they are in and with all the information obtained
      so far, I am fairly confident that their deaths happened no more than 20 or
      30 years ago.
    speaker: 1
  - text: We were so close to meeting them...
    speaker: 0
  - text: Indeed. I also noticed that while I haven't fully deciphered how their
      calendar works, the difference in dates between the earliest recovered document
      and this last one is likely less than 6 months.
    speaker: 1
  - text: So does that mean this invading species exterminated the whole planet in
      just a few months?
    speaker: 0
  - text: Seems to be the case.
    speaker: 1
  - text: Then we should probably send a message to Earth right now. Let's head back
      to the ship.
    speaker: 0
